# Local-only agent/workflow artifacts (backed up to a separate private remote)
# NOTES/ is anchored to the repo root on purpose: a bare `NOTES/` rule also
# matches any directory named Notes anywhere (case-insensitively), which would
# silently exclude sources such as src/Infrastructure/Notes/ from version
# control.
AGENTS.md
.flybywire/
docs/
/NOTES/

# Build artifacts
build/
out/
.vs/
*.user

# Release packaging
Releases/

# Local deploy staging
dist/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
